<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2740] .NET: IGNITE_HOME resolution restricts custom deployment</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2740</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Need to make sure that users may deploy Ignite JARs with their applications in any way they want.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Currently we have quite restrictive checks in IgniteHome.IsIgniteHome method.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Documentation should also be updated with &quot;Deployment&quot; page.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12945869">IGNITE-2740</key>
            <summary>.NET: IGNITE_HOME resolution restricts custom deployment</summary>
