                            <comment id="15175499" author="ptupitsyn" created="Wed, 2 Mar 2016 12:13:00 +0000"  >&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Removed exception on failed IGNITE_HOME resolve (it was added incorrectly as part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1626&quot; title=&quot;.Net: Create NuGet package.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-1626&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-1626&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Added documentation: &lt;a href=&quot;https://apacheignite-net.readme.io/docs/deployment&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://apacheignite-net.readme.io/docs/deployment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1626&quot; title=&quot;.Net: Create NuGet package.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-1626&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-1626&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; also introduced another way: put jars into &quot;libs&quot; folder near Apache.Ignite.Core.dll. We can add that to the documentation after release.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
